  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Icod.Terminal 1.1.0 adds typed, bounded VS Code OSC 633 shell-integration output while preserving the stable 1.0 contract. The new TerminalSession APIs cover prompt start/end, pre-execution, command completion, exact command-line publication with VS Code escaping and optional nonce, and the stable documented Cwd, IsWindows, ContinuationPrompt, and HasRichCommandDetection properties. OSC 633 remains a distinct vendor-specific protocol family rather than an alias for OSC 133; unfinalized F/G and H/I markers, SetMark, EnvJson/EnvSingle environment transfer, and any generic raw OSC 633 escape hatch remain excluded. The release retains net8.0/net9.0/net10.0, existing dependencies, and all prior 1.x semantics. Full notes: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.1.0/docs/releases/1.1.0.md ; compatibility: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.1.0/docs/Compatibility-and-Versioning.md",
